Leading. Checking who's behind.

3
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Heavy traffic.
Two minutes focused ahead...

4
00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:17.500
Empty mirror. Missed the light?

5
00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:21.000
Plot twist: ikaw pala ang naiwan?

6
00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Group rides shouldn't be a guessing game.

7
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000
See your tropa on one shared map.

8
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Who's ahead? Who's behind?
Ayun pala sila.

9
00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:39.500
Outside the Ride Master's set distance?

10
00:00:39.500 --> 00:00:44.000
A separation alert means it's time to regroup.

11
00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:49.000
Create a ride. Share the six-character code.

12
00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:52.000
Join the convoy.

13
00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:55.000
Invite RideOut friends directly, too.

14
00:00:55.000 --> 00:01:01.000
